== About me
I am a PhD student in the Robotics and Intelligent Vehicles Research Lab 
([https://robot.neu.edu/ RIVeR Lab]) at Northeastern University, advised by 
Professor Taskin Padir. I am interested in optimization, control, and machine 
learning, currently with applications in autonomous driving and robotics. My PhD 
research is focused on algorithms for distributed control of vehicle platoons.

Outside of work, I enjoy skiing, beach volleyball, surfing, running, yoga, 
reading, cooking, and watching movies or shows.

== Education
- Ph.D. in Electrical Engineering, Northeastern University, May 2019 - Apr. 2025
- M.S. in Electrical Engineering, Northeastern University, May 2019 - Dec. 2021
- B.S. in Mechanical Engineering, University of Maryland, Aug. 2013 - Dec. 2017

